@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@datasetId = 1
@runId = 1

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Proveedores habilitados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/providers

### Prueba de humo de un proveedor (no se persiste)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "OPENAI",
  "description": "La impresora de logística no enciende; las demás áreas trabajan con normalidad."
}

### Datasets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/datasets

### Importar XLSX
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasets/import?name=LOSMATUS&version=v1.0&description=Dataset%20validado
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Dataset_Corregido_Tesis_LOSMATUS.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./sample-data/Dataset_Corregido_Tesis_LOSMATUS.xlsx
--boundary--

### Partición estratificada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/datasets/{{datasetId}}/split
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainRatio": 0.6,
  "validationRatio": 0.1,
  "testRatio": 0.3,
  "seed": 20260720
}

### Ejecutar comparación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/comparisons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "datasetId": {{datasetId}},
  "split": "TEST",
  "providers": ["OPENAI", "GEMINI", "CLAUDE"]
}

### Exportar TRAIN canónico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/datasets/{{datasetId}}/fine-tuning/canonical.jsonl?split=TRAIN

### Exportar TRAIN para fine-tuning de OpenAI
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/datasets/{{datasetId}}/fine-tuning/openai.jsonl?split=TRAIN

### Estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{runId}}

### Resultados por ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{runId}}/results

### Métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{runId}}/metrics

### Reanudar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/evaluations/{{runId}}/resume

### Fase 2: consultar técnicos y niveles por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/technicians

### Fase 2: consultar pesos parametrizables
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/policies/controlled-simulation-v2

### Fase 2: consultar afinidad mínima por severidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/policies/controlled-simulation-v2/thresholds

### Fase 2: modificar nivel de un técnico (0 a 4)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/technicians/1/skills/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": 4,
  "validatedBy": "Responsable técnico LOSMATUS"
}

### Fase 2: modificar pesos de severidad alta (deben sumar 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/policies/controlled-simulation-v2/severities/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "affinity": 0.79,
  "load": 0.21
}

### Fase 2: modificar afinidad mínima para severidad alta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/configuration/policies/controlled-simulation-v2/thresholds/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minimumAffinity": 0.75
}

### Fase 2: simulación principal con carga cero y todos disponibles
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationRunId": {{runId}},
  "policyVersion": "controlled-simulation-v2",
  "strategy": "MULTICRITERIA",
  "scenario": "E1_CARGA_CERO_TODOS_DISPONIBLES",
  "availabilityOverrides": {
    "TEC-001": true,
    "TEC-002": true,
    "TEC-003": true
  },
  "initialLoads": {
    "TEC-001": 0,
    "TEC-002": 0,
    "TEC-003": 0
  }
}

### Baseline por afinidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationRunId": {{runId}},
  "strategy": "AFFINITY_ONLY",
  "scenario": "BASELINE_AFINIDAD"
}

### Baseline round-robin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/simulations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationRunId": {{runId}},
  "strategy": "ROUND_ROBIN",
  "scenario": "BASELINE_ROUND_ROBIN"
}
